343
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:34,170
CITY Z FORUM – IS IT TRUE
A CLASS C HERO DESTROYED THE TOWN?

344
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:45,430
- Give it up! Give it up! Give it up!
- Give it up! Give it up! ive it up!

345
00:18:45,430 --> 00:18:47,550
- Give it up! Give it up!
- Give it up! Give it up!

346
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:50,010
Is this what you call
mob mentality?

347
00:18:50,010 --> 00:18:52,770
They're all chanting in unison.

348
00:18:52,770 --> 00:18:55,900
Give it up! Give it up! Give it up!

349
00:18:56,870 --> 00:18:58,190
Saitama...

350
00:18:58,370 --> 00:19:01,940
Without a doubt,
you saved this city.

351
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:04,860
Yet look how the city treats you.

352
00:19:04,860 --> 00:19:06,870
This is reality, though.

353
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:11,620
You're strong, the strongest man
I've ever seen.

354
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:14,620
That's why I refrain
from saying anything.

355
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:18,880
I'd hate to see you rotting away
in this industry.

356
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:21,920
Resigning is also an option.

357
00:19:22,150 --> 00:19:24,630
Time to finish him off!

358
00:19:24,630 --> 00:19:25,840
Hey!

359
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:27,970
He's getting ready to fight!

360
00:19:27,970 --> 00:19:29,640
Huh? What are you talking—

361
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:30,650
No way!

362
00:19:30,650 --> 00:19:32,680
You're gonna take out
your frustration

363
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:36,140
on these people here,
just like you destroyed their city?!

364
00:19:36,290 --> 00:19:38,270
Do you just kill everyone
you don't like?

365
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:40,150
I won't let you do that!

366
00:19:40,210 --> 00:19:42,900
We, the Tank-top Brothers,
will not stand by

367
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:44,030
and let you resort to violence!

368
00:19:44,170 --> 00:19:48,030
If you're a hero,
then fight us fair and square!

369
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:51,030
So they're out to crush a rookie

370
00:19:51,030 --> 00:19:54,370
and perform a publicity stunt
at the same time.

371
00:19:55,040 --> 00:19:57,460
I'd say they've gotten a little greedy.

372
00:19:57,810 --> 00:20:00,590
No wonder they can't rise
above Class B.

373
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:01,960
Yeah!

374
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,050
Go, Tank-top!

375
00:20:03,050 --> 00:20:03,960
Do it!

376
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:10,310
Tank-top Tiger,
who fights like a true tiger, and...

377
00:20:10,310 --> 00:20:12,350
Tank-top Black Hole,

378
00:20:12,350 --> 00:20:15,560
who crushes all
with a grip strength of 2,800 psi!

379
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:20,360
We brothers will punish all
who stray from the path of the hero!

380
00:20:23,750 --> 00:20:24,480
Huh?

381
00:20:25,790 --> 00:20:26,900
Damn it!

382
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:28,860
I'll rip you apart!

383
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:34,240
I give up! I give up!

384
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:36,000
You're crushing my hand!

385
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:36,620
Huh?

386
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:38,330
You're kidding, right?

387
00:20:38,470 --> 00:20:41,340
I give up for real.
I'm sorry!

388
00:20:41,340 --> 00:20:44,130
I'm sorry for lying!

389
00:20:44,190 --> 00:20:46,170
No, you weren't lying.

390
00:20:47,110 --> 00:20:49,510
I'm the one who smashed
the meteor!

391
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:51,720
Anyone with a complaint,
let's hear it.

392
00:20:51,950 --> 00:20:53,010
Speak up!

393
00:20:55,870 --> 00:20:58,350
Because of you,
my brand new car was—

394
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:00,730
You can shut up!

395
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:03,400
Why would I give a crap
about your problems?

396
00:21:03,580 --> 00:21:06,110
Tell it to the meteor, jackass!

397
00:21:06,110 --> 00:21:07,400
Listen up!

398
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:11,320
I don't do this hero-thing
for admiration!

399
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:14,080
I do it because I want to!

400
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:15,990
So if you wanna blame me,
go ahead!

401
00:21:15,990 --> 00:21:17,000
You baldies!

402
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,290
You're the baldy...

403
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:20,630
What'd you say?!

404
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:21,920
Master.

405
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:24,130
Oh, it's you, Genos.

406
00:21:24,690 --> 00:21:25,800
Hang on.

407
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:26,590
These guys—

408
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:27,880
Let's go home,

409
00:21:28,230 --> 00:21:29,340
Master.

410
00:21:34,140 --> 00:21:36,140
Oh yeah?

411
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:41,400
Dammit. That guy's face
is burned into my brain.

412
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:43,310
I'm gonna remember this.

413
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,110
Master.

414
00:21:45,650 --> 00:21:50,740
I have never met any person
as incredible as you, Master Saitama.

415
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,740
What brought that on?

416
00:21:52,740 --> 00:21:53,910
You're creeping me out.

417
00:21:54,670 --> 00:21:56,910
Even if the public
doesn't appreciate you,

418
00:21:57,590 --> 00:21:59,540
I will still follow you.

419
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:04,130
You don't have to
butter me up. Really.

